  -- 1. Use toeplitz_quadratic_form to rewrite numerator as ∫ P |p|²
  -- 2. Use hP_ge to get ∫ P |p|² ≥ ∫ m |p|² = m ∫ |p|²
  -- 3. Use parseval_trig_poly to get ∫ |p|² = ‖v‖²
